{"ordinal":13448,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452870447105","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Ears_DontShoot_03c4a77","source":"Alkonost: Все эти признаки… не знаю, иногда мне кажется, что всё это какая-то… шиза.","target":"Alkonost: Toate semnele astea… nu știu, uneori mi se pare că totul e o… nebunie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-340.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13449,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452870447104","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Ears_DontShoot_048ffdb","source":"Alkonost: Надеюсь, КЧС понимают, что делают.","target":"Alkonost: Sper că cei de la Comitet știu ce fac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-340.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13450,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452866252808","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Ears_DontShoot_0bae7ff","source":"Alkonost: Я чуть от страха не умерла.","target":"Alkonost: Aproape că am murit de frică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-340.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13451,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452866252807","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Photo_DontShoot_0989b88","source":"Alkonost: Он… он скоро приедет помочь нам с сестрой.","target":"Alkonost: El… el va veni curând să ne ajute pe mine și pe sora mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-340.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13452,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452866252806","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Photo_DontShoot_0c61208","source":"Alkonost: Я и так сильно нервничаю из-за мужа.","target":"Alkonost: Și așa sunt foarte îngrijorată pentru soțul meu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-340.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13453,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452866252805","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Photo_DontShoot_0e11b0a","source":"Alkonost: Значит, ты так пошутил? Не делай так больше, пожалуйста.","target":"Alkonost: Deci a fost o glumă? Te rog, să nu mai faci asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-340.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
